# What never enters a Docker image built from the repository root.

# Secrets — the server's environment is given at run time, never baked in.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!client/.env.production

# Demo accounts with a password written in the repository (see Backend/dev-only/README.md).
Backend/dev-only/

# Built or installed inside the image itself.
**/node_modules/
Backend/dist/
client/dist/
**/coverage/

# Tests, and what they leave behind.
Backend/tests/
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
client/e2e/
client/playwright-report/
client/test-results/
Backend/uploads/

# Tooling.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
